sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Employee / User
    participant App as App / MainActivity
    participant Repo as ApiTaskRepository
    participant Room as Room Database (SSOT)
    participant WM as WorkManager Scheduler
    participant Worker as TaskSyncWorker
    participant Server as Mock / Remote API

    User->>App: Add Task / Complete Task (Offline / Airplane Mode)
    App->>Repo: addTask() / completeTask()
    Repo->>Room: Insert / Update Task (syncState = PENDING, syncOp = CREATE/UPDATE)
    Repo->>WM: WorkManagerScheduler.scheduleSync(context)
    WM-->>WM: EnqueueUniqueWork (ExistingWorkPolicy.KEEP, NetworkType.CONNECTED)

    Note over WM,Worker: Network Connectivity Restored
    WM->>Worker: Trigger doWork() (CoroutineWorker)
    Worker->>Room: resetSyncingToPending() (Crash recovery)
    Worker->>Room: getPendingSyncTasks()
    Room-->>Worker: List<TaskEntity> [PENDING / SYNCING]
    Worker->>Room: markTasksSyncing(ids) [Atomic Claiming]

    loop For Each Pending Task
        Worker->>Server: POST /tasks or PATCH /tasks/:id (with stable clientTaskId)
        alt Case A: Success (200 OK / 201 Created)
            Server-->>Worker: Success Response
            Worker->>Room: markTaskSyncedConditional(id, capturedUpdatedAt)
            Room-->>Worker: syncState = SYNCED, syncOp = NONE
        else Case B: Timeout After Server Save / Transient Error
            Server-->>Worker: SocketTimeoutException / HTTP 504 (Task committed on server)
            Worker->>Room: revertTaskSyncingToPending(id)
            Worker-->>WM: Result.retry() (Exponential Backoff)
            Note over Worker,Server: WorkManager Retries with SAME clientTaskId
            Worker->>Server: POST /tasks (Retry with stable clientTaskId)
            Server->>Server: Detect existing clientTaskId (PRIMARY KEY constraint)
            Server-->>Worker: 200 OK (Idempotent success, zero duplicates created)
            Worker->>Room: markTaskSyncedConditional(id, capturedUpdatedAt)
        end
    end
    Worker-->>WM: Result.success()
